        {
          "type": "intro",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "hero"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "hero-eyebrow"
              },
              "html": "Caresse vs Pura Sensa · 18+"
            },
            {
              "tag": "h1",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "A Pura Sensa alternative.<br><em>Your session, your preferences.</em>"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {},
              "html": "Looking for intimate audio created for you? Caresse generates fiction guided by a synthetic voice, with your names or nicknames, solo or as a duo. Discover free demos in the app, then create sessions with paid credits and no subscription."
            },
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "cta-group"
              },
              "html": "<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-cta\" class=\"cta-pink\" data-store-auto data-cta-position=\"hero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download for free</a>"
            },
            {
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "hero-badge"
              },
              "html": "Anonymous mode · Free demos · iOS and Android<br>Paid personalized sessions, no subscription."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "tldr"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "Two approaches to intimate audio"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Select a session or create your own."
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "tldr-card"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "p",
                  "attrs": {},
                  "html": "Pura Sensa organizes guided sessions for solo and couple use, with voice, ambient sound and optional binaural audio. Caresse creates narration from your setup: participants, chosen names, atmosphere and preferences."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "verdict",
            "id": "verdict"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "Comparison"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Caresse vs Pura Sensa"
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "verdict-table-wrap",
                "tabindex": "0",
                "role": "region",
                "aria-label": "Caresse vs Pura Sensa"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "table",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "verdict-table"
                  },
                  "html": "<thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Criterion</th><th scope=\"col\">Caresse</th><th scope=\"col\">Pura Sensa</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Format</th><td class=\"caresse\">Audio fiction generated on demand</td><td class=\"other\">A library of guided sessions to select</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Personalization</th><td class=\"caresse\">Your names and preferences shape generation</td><td class=\"other\">Generation using your names is not advertised on the pages reviewed</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Getting started</th><td class=\"caresse\">Free download and demos</td><td class=\"other\">A free Explore tier is advertised</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Couples</th><td class=\"caresse\">Duo mode with credits, no subscription</td><td class=\"other\">Couples sessions advertised with the annual plan</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Sound</th><td class=\"caresse\">Synthetic voice and atmosphere based on setup</td><td class=\"other\">Voice, ambient sound and optional binaural audio</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Account</th><td class=\"caresse\">Anonymous mode, including purchases from Caresse</td><td class=\"other\">Free tier without an account; Premium accounts mentioned in the FAQ</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"crit\">Access</th><td class=\"caresse\">iOS and Android app</td><td class=\"other\">Web, iOS and Android advertised</td></tr>\n        </tbody>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "cta-group",
                "style": "margin-top:32px"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "a",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US",
                    "class": "cta-pink",
                    "data-store-auto": "",
                    "data-cta-position": "inline",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "rel": "noopener"
                  },
                  "html": "Download for free"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "columns"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "Two approaches to intimate audio"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "How does the experience work?"
            },
            {
              "type": "cards",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "columns-grid"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "col-card highlight"
                  },
                  "html": "<p class=\"col-sub\">Caresse</p><h3>Fiction created for your moment.</h3><p>Choose solo or duo mode and the preferences available in the app. Names or nicknames help personalize narration, read by a synthetic voice.</p><p>A demo is a fixed example. A personalized session is generated after setup and uses a paid credit. Length and content can vary. Every suggestion remains optional.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "col-card muted"
                  },
                  "html": "<p class=\"col-sub\">Pura Sensa</p><h3>Sessions organized by practice.</h3><p>Pura Sensa separates its library into solo and couple sessions. Its FAQ describes sessions lasting ten to forty-five minutes and offline access for Premium.</p><p>The pages reviewed focus on selecting sessions and plans. They do not document narration generated from each person’s names and preferences.</p>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "pricing"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "Pricing and access"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Credits or a Premium subscription."
            },
            {
              "type": "cards",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "pricing-grid"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "price-card highlight"
                  },
                  "html": "<h3>Caresse</h3><p class=\"price-big\">Per session, no subscription</p><p class=\"price-note\">The app and demos are free. Creating a session uses a paid credit. An optional one-time purchase unlocks more preferences; it does not include unlimited generation.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "price-card"
                  },
                  "html": "<h3>Pura Sensa</h3><p class=\"price-big\">Free Explore + Premium</p><p class=\"price-note\">The pricing page advertises three free sessions per month and a Premium subscription at £9.99 monthly or £89.99 annually. Couples sessions and a partner pass are associated with the annual plan.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "pricing-footnote"
              },
              "html": "Pura Sensa prices published for the UK App Store, recorded on 31 October 2026; terms and prices may vary by platform. Caresse prices are shown in the app before purchase. <a href=\"/en/pricing/\">Caresse pricing</a>."
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "pricing-footnote"
              },
              "html": "Published by Caresse, without independent product testing. Sources: Pura Sensa home page, Sessions, Pricing and FAQ, reviewed on 31 October 2026."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "faq"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
              },
              "html": "Frequently asked questions"
            },
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "h2",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-title"
              },
              "html": "Before choosing your audio."
            },
            {
              "type": "faq",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "faq-list"
              },
              "prefix": "",
              "suffix": "",
              "items": [
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "What is the difference between Pura Sensa and Caresse?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Pura Sensa presents a library of guided audio sessions. Caresse generates fiction from your names, solo or duo mode and preferences. Both offer intimate audio; their creation and payment models differ."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Is Caresse a Pura Sensa alternative without a subscription?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Yes. Downloading Caresse and its demos are free. Personalized sessions use paid credits, without a subscription. The optional advanced-preferences unlock is a separate purchase."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Does Pura Sensa also offer free access?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Yes. A free tier is advertised, with additional features in Premium. Caresse also offers free demos; its personalized generation remains paid."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Can I use Caresse alone or as a couple?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Yes. Configure one profile in solo mode or two in duo mode. Each person chooses preferences freely and can refuse a suggestion or stop at any time."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Which languages can Caresse generate audio in?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "French, English, Spanish and Portuguese. Published demos are in French, English and Spanish. The Portuguese interface is available on Android; the iOS update is awaiting approval."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "faq-item"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tag": "h3",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Does the buyer remain anonymous to Caresse?"
                    },
                    {
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {},
                      "html": "Yes. Anonymous mode does not require a Caresse account, and Caresse does not know the buyer’s identity. Purchases are processed through your Apple or Google account and its payment method."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "cta-section",
            "id": "download"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "element",
              "tag": "p",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-label"
